--------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This dashboard bundles no third-party images, media, fonts or libraries. It
is a single self-contained HTML file with no external requests.

Instrument, platform and assay names referred to in the teaching text
(for example BACTEC, VITEK, MicroScan, Phoenix, GeneXpert, BioFire,
MALDI-TOF) are the trademarks of their respective owners and are used here
only descriptively, to name equipment a student will encounter on the
bench. No affiliation, sponsorship or endorsement is implied.

